{
	"name": "Wrathful Retaliation",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/magic/fire/explosion-embers-evade-silhouette.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>At 11th level, your wrath burns hottest against those who harm the ones you choose to protect. As a reaction to an ally in your threatened area being successfully hit by an attack roll, you can impose disadvantage on the attacker’s next saving throw if they are within 30ft.</p><p>You may use this ability once per short rest at no cost, but if you use it again before taking a short rest you gain a level of Strife.</p>",
